WEBVTT

00:00.308 --> 00:01.488
Hello, Zcash community!

00:01.822 --> 00:04.455
Today we’ll use Vizor on mobile to
vote.

00:04.788 --> 00:05.555
Let’s get started.

00:06.102 --> 00:09.376
This proposal would wind down ZCG
and end new grants.

00:09.896 --> 00:11.349
Grants already awarded would
continue,

00:11.516 --> 00:14.436
with payments made as agreed
milestones are met.

00:14.722 --> 00:17.302
After covering existing grants and
wind-down costs,

00:17.582 --> 00:21.249
remaining funds would go to the
Future Dev and Legal Defense Fund
lockbox.

00:21.856 --> 00:25.916
If ZCG’s 8% funding stream is still
active when the upgrade takes
effect,

00:26.209 --> 00:29.622
it would go to that lockbox until
the November 2028 halving.

00:30.133 --> 00:34.803
This proposal would redirect ZCG’s
8% funding stream to a new Future
Dev and

00:34.817 --> 00:39.112
Legal Defense Fund lockbox requiring
community approval for
disbursements,

00:39.339 --> 00:43.692
require ZCG to contribute 50,000 ZEC
to the NSM,

00:43.706 --> 00:47.972
and preserve ZCG and its grant
program with its remaining treasury.

00:48.488 --> 00:53.554
This proposal would retain ZCG’s
existing treasury and continue its
8%

00:53.568 --> 00:55.734
funding stream through November
2028.

00:56.368 --> 01:00.668
It would rename the grant program
and its pool of funds to Zcash
Adoption

01:00.681 --> 01:05.194
Pool, consistent with using those
funds to increase Zcash and ZEC
adoption

01:05.381 --> 01:06.554
as broadly as possible.

01:06.968 --> 01:10.641
It would also leave open the
possibility of using funds from the
existing

01:10.654 --> 01:13.488
treasury for development and legal
defense.

01:13.999 --> 01:15.679
This is the status quo option.

01:16.046 --> 01:20.979
ZCG would continue receiving its 8%
funding stream through the November
2028

01:21.079 --> 01:24.446
halving, and its treasury and
operations would remain unchanged.

01:25.033 --> 01:27.400
Assuming it can be done safely in a
network upgrade,

01:27.653 --> 01:31.040
do you support reducing Zcash’s
target block time from 25 seconds to
20

01:31.053 --> 01:31.440
seconds?

01:32.225 --> 01:34.492
Open Settings and tap Coinholder
voting.

01:35.808 --> 01:38.682
Find the NU7.1 poll and tap Vote.

01:39.392 --> 01:40.865
Scroll through the five proposals.

01:41.012 --> 01:42.638
Read each one and choose your
answers.

01:45.225 --> 01:46.952
Tap Review answers and check your
ballot.

01:48.142 --> 01:50.042
When you’re ready, tap Confirm and
submit.

01:50.892 --> 01:53.298
Keep Vizor open while your vote is
submitted.

01:54.558 --> 01:57.278
When you see the green check and the
word Voted, you’re

01:57.278 --> 01:57.798
all set.

01:58.531 --> 02:00.578
Your vote helps shape the future of
Zcash.

02:00.964 --> 02:01.604
Happy voting.
